Z||000015||Neal||10-07-2001||05:27 PM||||Low 14's is exactly what im shooting for.<P>As it sits right now<BR>Unassembled 3.4, fully balanced<BR>compucam 2030 (soon to get 1.6 rockers)<BR>ported intake<BR>ported exaust mainfolds<BR>"beautiful" valve job (as my machineist described it)<BR>cloyes true roller timing chain<BR>dynagear high volume oil pump<BR>heat wrapped exaust, manifolds and cross-over<BR>MSD 6a box and coil<BR>holley adjustible fuel pressure regulator<P>and a few other goodies i cant think of<BR>Im saving my pennies for headers and 2.5" exaust and cold air intake.||||reg||1
